    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To mitigate one potential issue, our must work closely with the client to choose a cost-efficient configuration while preserving an acceptable margin." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Another challenge could be scaling the solution for progressive deployment after The pilot phase while maintaining costs within the projected budget. our financial capacity and current revenue growth suggest that our should be able to manage costs, but careful planning and monitoring will be necessary to avoid any unexpected expenses." ;
