    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Lastly, ensuring compliance with The client's requirements for a cost-optimizing approach and providing a high-quality solution within the given budget constraints will be crucial in managing budgetary risks. our finance role works closely with the architect to keep the configuration within the SME envelope while preserving an acceptable margin, which should help mitigate budgetary risks." ;
