    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Can our company's LLM stack, RAG capabilities, fine-tuning methods, explainability tools, performance benchmarks, past AI use cases, and known trade-offs meet these expectations, and what are the potential innovation risks or challenges in implementing this solution? our company's, can provide an artificial intelligence assistance solution that meets the client's requirements. our company's Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) capabilities allow our company's to generate answers grounded in validated material, which ensures the reliability of figures and preserves professional secrecy." ;
