    <http://example.org/node/chunk144> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client wishes to limit the environmental footprint of the solution and rely as far as possible on low-carbon infrastructure. the solution must also comply with SecNumCloud requirements and ensure data sovereignty." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk145> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What are our company's EcoVadis rating, carbon footprint, green hosting partners, digital sobriety practices, social commitments, AI ethics principles, and known sustainability trade-offs, and how do they align with these expectations? our company's, has an EcoVadis rating of Silver. our company's have conducted a bilan carbone assessment, which covers scopes 1, 2, and main scope 3 items, including cloud inference. our company's also have a published trajectory to reduce our company's carbon intensity per managed assistant year on year." ;
