    <http://example.org/node/chunk147> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This alignment with low-carbon infrastructure should support the client's environmental goals. our company's practice digital sobriety through model right-sizing, caching, and batching, which helps reduce our company's environmental footprint. our company's social commitments include being a signatory to the Responsible Tech Charter, having gender balance and inclusion objectives, and offering an apprenticeship and work-study program. our company's also have a research partnership with the Grenoble research ecosystem. our company's AI ethics principles are published and include human oversight, transparency and source grounding, bias monitoring, data minimization, and a documented data-use policy." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

